  "notes": "Contributor is a discounted pricing tier of the same model (muse-spark-1.2-contributor) that permits Meta to train on prompts and completions; not a variant. Categorised as code because Meta presents this release as a coding-focused update. No weights were published in Meta's Hugging Face organisation meta-models by 2026-10-01; the Muse Spark 1.3 blog lists a Muse Spark open weights release on its roadmap without naming a version, so openWeights is not set."
